parameters.body/messageBody:
## ⚠️ Overdue Enabling Task — Action Required

**Task:** @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['Title']}
**Site:** @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['Site']}
**Department:** @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['Department']}
**Was due:** @{formatDateTime(items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['PlannedEndDate'], 'dd MMM yyyy')}
**Days overdue:** @{outputs('Calculate_Days_Overdue')} day(s)
**Current status:** @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['Status']}
@{if(equals(items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['IsOnCriticalPath'], true), '🔴 **THIS TASK IS ON THE CRITICAL PATH — delay affects equipment movement schedule**', '')}

**Action required:** Open the Enabling Task Manager app, update the task status and add a delay reason if the task cannot be completed today.

*If this task has already been completed, please mark it complete in the app so this alert stops.*

## 🔴 ESCALATION — Critical Path Task Overdue

**Task:** @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['Title']}
**Site:** @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['Site']}
**Department:** @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['Department']}
**Planned completion:** @{formatDateTime(items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['PlannedEndDate'], 'dd MMM yyyy')}
**Days overdue:** @{outputs('Calculate_Days_Overdue')} day(s)

⚠️ This enabling task is on the critical path. Delay to this task will delay the next scheduled equipment movement.

The department superintendent has been notified. This escalation is for your awareness and schedule management.

*Linked equipment movement: @{items('Loop_Overdue_Tasks')?['EquipmentMovementId']?.Title}*
